              Lineare Gleichungssysteme
            </legend>
            <div class="space-y-1.5 text-sm">
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="lgs_addition" checked />
                <span>Additionsverfahren</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="lgs_einsetzen" checked />
                <span>Einsetzungsverfahren</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="lgs_gleichsetzen" checked />
                <span>Gleichsetzungsverfahren</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="lgs_keine_loesung" checked />
                <span>Keine Lösung erkennen</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="lgs_unendlich_viele" checked />
                <span>Unendlich viele Lösungen erkennen</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="lgs_schnittpunkt" checked />
                <span>Schnittpunkt zweier Geraden</span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
        ) : variant === 'termumformungen' ? (
          <fieldset class="ug-gruppe min-w-0 lg:col-span-2">
            <legend
              class="ug-steuerung-legend font-semibold text-sm text-ink-900 mb-3 dark:text-ink-50 pb-1 w-full"
            >
              Termumformungen · Bruchterme
            </legend>
            <div class="space-y-1.5 text-sm">
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="tu_kuerzen_faktor" checked />
                <span>Kürzen über gemeinsame Faktoren</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="tu_nicht_kuerzbar_summe" checked />
                <span>Fehlerdiagnose: Summen darf man nicht kürzen</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="tu_definitionsmenge" checked />
                <span>Definitionsmenge bestimmen</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="tu_addition" checked />
                <span>Bruchterme addieren</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="tu_multiplikation" checked />
                <span>Bruchterme multiplizieren</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="tu_hauptnenner" checked />
                <span>Auf Hauptnenner bringen</span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
        ) : variant === 'exponentialfunktionen' ? (
          <fieldset class="ug-gruppe min-w-0 lg:col-span-2">
            <legend
              class="ug-steuerung-legend font-semibold text-sm text-ink-900 mb-3 dark:text-ink-50 pb-1 w-full"
            >
              Exponentialfunktionen
            </legend>
            <div class="space-y-1.5 text-sm">
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="exp_wachstum_oder_zerfall" checked />
                <span>Wachstum oder Zerfall erkennen</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="exp_parameter" checked />
                <span>Anfangswert und Faktor ablesen</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="exp_funktionswert" checked />
                <span>Funktionswert berechnen</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="exp_faktor_aus_prozent" checked />
                <span>Faktor $q$ aus Prozentangabe</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="exp_verdopplung_halbierung" checked />
                <span>Verdopplungs-/Halbwertszeit (Faustregel)</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="exp_einfache_gleichung" checked />
                <span>Einfache Exponentialgleichung</span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
        ) : variant === 'logarithmen' ? (
          <fieldset class="ug-gruppe min-w-0 lg:col-span-2">
            <legend
              class="ug-steuerung-legend font-semibold text-sm text-ink-900 mb-3 dark:text-ink-50 pb-1 w-full"
            >
              Logarithmen
            </legend>
            <div class="space-y-1.5 text-sm">
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="log_basis_zwei" checked />
                <span>Grundaufgaben mit Basis 2</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="log_zehner_differenz" checked />
                <span>Zehnerlogarithmus und Differenzen</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="log_exponentialgleichung" checked />
                <span>Exponentialgleichung mit Logarithmus lösen</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="log_eins" checked />
                <span>Spezialwert: $\log_a(1)$</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="log_basiswechsel" checked />
                <span>Basiswechsel mit $\ln$</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="log_produktregel" checked />
                <span>Produktregel anwenden</span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
        ) : variant === 'wurzelrechnung' ? (
          <fieldset class="ug-gruppe min-w-0 lg:col-span-2">
            <legend
              class="ug-steuerung-legend font-semibold text-sm text-ink-900 mb-3 dark:text-ink-50 pb-1 w-full"
            >
              Wurzelrechnung
            </legend>
            <div class="space-y-1.5 text-sm">
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="wr_vereinfachen" checked />
                <span>Wurzelausdrücke vereinfachen</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="wr_add_sub" checked />
                <span>Wurzeln addieren / subtrahieren</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="wr_fehlschluss_summe" checked />
                <span>Fehlschluss: Wurzel über Summen</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="wr_gleichung_quadrat" checked />
                <span>Gleichung $x^2=a$ lösen</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="wr_betrag" checked />
                <span>Regel $\sqrt(x^2)=|x|$ anwenden</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="wr_keine_reelle" checked />
                <span>Keine reellen Lösungen erkennen</span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
        ) : variant === 'kreisgeometrie' ? (
          <fieldset class="ug-gruppe min-w-0 lg:col-span-2">
            <legend
              class="ug-steuerung-legend font-semibold text-sm text-ink-900 mb-3 dark:text-ink-50 pb-1 w-full"
            >
              Kreisgeometrie
            </legend>
            <div class="space-y-1.5 text-sm">
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="kg_radius_zu_durchmesser" checked />
                <span>Radius → Durchmesser</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="kg_durchmesser_zu_radius" checked />
                <span>Durchmesser → Radius</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="kg_umfang" checked />
                <span>Umfang berechnen: $U=2\pi r$</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="kg_flaeche" checked />
                <span>Flächeninhalt berechnen: $A=\pi r^2$</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="kg_sektor_anteil" checked />
                <span>Sektor-Anteil aus Mittelpunktswinkel</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="kg_tangente_rechtwinklig" checked />
                <span>Tangente und Radius: rechter Winkel</span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
        ) : (
          <fieldset class="ug-gruppe min-w-0 lg:col-span-2">
            <legend
              class="ug-steuerung-legend font-semibold text-sm text-ink-900 mb-3 dark:text-ink-50 pb-1 w-full"
            >
              Strahlensätze
            </legend>
            <div class="space-y-1.5 text-sm">
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="strahl_zweiter_strecke" checked />
                <span>V-Figur: parallele Strecke (zweiter Strahlensatz)</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="strahl_erster_strahl" checked />
                <span>V-Figur: Strecke auf dem zweiten Strahl (erster Strahlensatz)</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="strahl_x_strecke" checked />
                <span>X-Figur: parallele Strecken</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="strahl_schatten" checked />
                <span>Schatten / gleiche Sonnenrichtung</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
                <input type="checkbox" class="ug-typ accent-accent-600" value="strahl_spiegel_mast" checked />
                <span>Spiegel &amp; Mast (ähnliche Dreiecke)</span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
        )
      }

      <fieldset class="ug-gruppe min-w-0 lg:col-span-2">
        <legend
          class="ug-steuerung-legend font-semibold text-sm text-ink-900 mb-3 dark:text-ink-50 pb-1 w-full"
        >
          Anzahl &amp; Layout
        </legend>
        <p class="text-xs font-medium text-teal-800 mb-2 dark:text-teal-200/90">
          Wie viele Aufgaben? (klassisch fürs Whiteboard)
        </p>
        <div id="ug-anzahl" class="inline-flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mb-4">
          <button
            type="button"
            data-anzahl="5"
            class="ug-anzahl rounded-md border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors">{5}</button>
          <button
            type="button"
            data-anzahl="10"
            class="ug-anzahl rounded-md border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors">{10}</button>
          <button
            type="button"
            data-anzahl="15"
            class="ug-anzahl rounded-md border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors">{15}</button>
          <button
            type="button"
            data-anzahl="20"
            class="ug-anzahl rounded-md border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors">{20}</button>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs font-medium text-violet-800 mb-2 dark:text-violet-200/90">Darstellung</p>
        <div id="ug-layout" class="inline-flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
          <button
            type="button"
            data-layout="arbeitsblatt"
            class="ug-layoutbtn rounded-md border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors">{'Arbeitsblatt'}</button>
          <button
            type="button"
            data-layout="whiteboard"
            class="ug-layoutbtn rounded-md border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors">{'Whiteboard'}</button>
        </div>
        {
          variant !== 'bruchgleichungen' &&
            variant !== 'wurzelrechnung' &&
            variant !== 'prozentrechnung' &&
            variant !== 'stochastik' &&
            variant !== 'binomische-formeln' &&
            variant !== 'termumformungen' &&
            variant !== 'exponentialfunktionen' &&
            variant !== 'logarithmen' && (
            <label class="mt-4 flex w-full min-w-0 cursor-pointer items-start gap-2 text-sm text-ink-800 dark:text-ink-200">
              <input
                type="checkbox"
                id="mu-practice-diagrams-checkbox"
                class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 accent-accent-600"
                aria-describedby="mu-practice-diagrams-hint"
              />
              <span class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                <span class="font-medium text-ink-900 dark:text-ink-50">Grafiken / Skizzen anzeigen</span>
                <span
                  id="mu-practice-diagrams-hint"
                  class="mt-0.5 block max-w-full break-words text-xs font-normal text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-400"
                >
                  Voreinstellung: Skizzen aus. Pro Aufgabe gibt es ein Augen-Symbol zum Ein- und Ausblenden (wird ebenfalls gespeichert).
                </span>
              </span>
            </label>
          )
        }
      </fieldset>
    </div>

    <div
      class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 border-t border-accent-200/60 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-accent-50/30 to-teal-50/25 pt-6 dark:border-accent-700/50 dark:from-transparent dark:via-accent-900/25 dark:to-teal-900/20"
    >
      <button
        id="ug-erzeugen"
        type="button"
        class="rounded-md bg-accent-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-white font-semibold hover:bg-accent-700 transition dark:bg-accent-500 dark:hover:bg-accent-600"
      >
        Aufgaben erzeugen
      </button>
      <button
        id="ug-drucken"
        type="button"
        class="rounded-md border border-ink-300 bg-surface px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-ink-50 dark:border-slate-600/55 dark:bg-slate-900/75 dark:text-ink-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800/85"
        hidden
      >
        Arbeitsblatt drucken
      </button>
      <button
        id="ug-alle-aufdecken"
        type="button"
        class="rounded-md border border-ink-300 bg-surface px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-ink-50 dark:border-slate-600/55 dark:bg-slate-900/75 dark:text-ink-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800/85"
        hidden
      >
        Alle Lösungen aufdecken
      </button>
      <button
        id="ug-alle-zuklappen"
        type="button"
        class="rounded-md border border-ink-300 bg-surface px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-ink-50 dark:border-slate-600/55 dark:bg-slate-900/75 dark:text-ink-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800/85"
        hidden
      >
        Alle Lösungen verbergen
      </button>
      <button
        id="ug-route-speichern"
        type="button"
        class="rounded-md border border-ink-300 bg-surface px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-ink-50 dark:border-slate-600/55 dark:bg-slate-900/75 dark:text-ink-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800/85"
        hidden
      >
        Whiteboard-Route speichern
      </button>
      <button
        id="ug-route-laden"
        type="button"
        class="rounded-md border border-ink-300 bg-surface px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-ink-50 dark:border-slate-600/55 dark:bg-slate-900/75 dark:text-ink-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800/85"
      >
        Route laden
      </button>
      <input id="ug-route-datei" type="file" accept=".html,.json,text/html,application/json" class="sr-only" />
      <p id="ug-fehler" class="text-sm text-red-600 dark:text-red-300" hidden>Mindestens einen Aufgabentyp auswählen.</p>
      <p id="ug-route-status" class="text-sm text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div
    id="ug-wb-vorbereitung"
    class="mb-6 rounded-lg border border-accent-300 bg-accent-50 p-4 text-sm text-ink-800 shadow-sm dark:border-accent-600 dark:bg-accent-900/25 dark:text-ink-100 print:hidden"
    hidden
    role="status"
  >
    <p class="font-medium text-ink-900 dark:text-ink-50">{wbLabel}</p>
    <div class="mt-2 flex items-center text-ink-700 dark:text-ink-200" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <rect x="3.5" y="4.5" width="17" height="11" rx="1.5"></rect>
        <path d="M8 20h8"></path>
        <path d="M12 15.5V20"></path>
        <path d="M7 9h10"></path>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-1 text-ink-700 dark:text-ink-200">
      Wähle oben Aufgabentypen und Anzahl, dann <strong>Aufgaben erzeugen</strong>. Die Vollbild-Whiteboard-Ansicht erscheint erst, wenn Aufgaben da sind.
    </p>
    <button
      type="button"
      id="ug-wb-vorbereitung-zu-ab"
      class="mt-3 rounded-md border border-ink-300 bg-surface px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink-900 hover:bg-ink-50 dark:border-slate-600/55 dark:bg-slate-900/75 dark:text-ink-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-800/85"
    >
      Zum Arbeitsblatt wechseln
    </button>
  </div>

  <section
    id="ug-arbeitsblatt"
    aria-label="Aufgaben (Arbeitsblatt)"
    class="rounded-xl border border-ink-200 bg-surface p-6 md:p-8 mu-dark-glass-panel"
    hidden
  >
    <ol id="ug-liste" class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-5 marker:font-serif marker:text-ink-500 dark:marker:text-ink-400">
    </ol>
  </section>

  <div
    id="ug-wb-overlay"
    class="ug-wb-overlay pointer-events-auto fixed inset-0 z-[9999] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden overscroll-none bg-neutral-900/80 p-3 py-4 backdrop-blur-sm sm:p-4 sm:py-6 dark:bg-slate-950/80 dark:backdrop-blur-md print:hidden"
    hidden
    role="dialog"
    aria-modal="true"
    aria-label="Whiteboard"
  >
    <div id="ug-wb-scale-box" class="ug-wb-scale-box w-full max-w-4xl shrink-0 overflow-hidden">
      <div id="ug-wb-scale-inner" class="ug-wb-scale-inner origin-top-left">
        <section
          id="ug-whiteboard"
          aria-label={`Aufgaben (${wbLabel})`}
          class="mu-katex-skip flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-ink-200 bg-surface p-6 shadow-2xl sm:p-8 md:p-10 min-h-[min(52vh,30rem)] dark:border-slate-600/70 dark:bg-gradient-to-b dark:from-slate-900 dark:via-slate-900 dark:to-slate-950 dark:shadow-[0_28px_64px_-18px_rgba(0,0,0,0.55),0_0_0_1px_rgba(59,130,246,0.14),0_0_120px_-48px_rgba(59,130,246,0.18)]"
        >
        <div
          class="mb-4 flex w-full shrink-0 flex-nowrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-ink-200 pb-4 dark:border-slate-700/80"
        >
          <span
            class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-700 before:inline-block before:h-1.5 before:w-1.5 before:shrink-0 before:rounded-full before:bg-accent-500 before:content-[''] dark:text-slate-200 dark:before:bg-accent-400"
            >Whiteboard</span>
          <div
            id="ug-wb-header-center"
            class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-nowrap items-center justify-center gap-x-2 overflow-hidden text-sm text-ink-600 dark:text-slate-400 sm:justify-end md:justify-center"
          >
            <span class="shrink-0 uppercase tracking-wide">
              Aufgabe <span id="ug-wb-i">1</span> / <span id="ug-wb-n">0</span>
            </span>
            <span class="hidden shrink-0 sm:inline text-ink-300 dark:text-slate-600" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
            <span id="ug-wb-zeit" class="shrink-0 font-mono tabular-nums" aria-live="polite">0:00</span>
            <div
              id="ug-wb-header-diagram-ui"
              class="flex shrink-0 flex-nowrap items-center justify-center gap-2 empty:hidden"
            ></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex shrink-0 flex-nowrap items-center gap-1.5">
            <button
              type="button"
              id="ug-wb-route-speichern"
              class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-ink-300 bg-ink-100 text-ink-900 shadow-sm hover:bg-ink-200 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent-500 dark:border-slate-500 dark:bg-slate-800/90 dark:text-slate-100 dark:shadow-sm dark:shadow-black/30 dark:hover:border-slate-400 dark:hover:bg-slate-700/95"
              aria-label="Route speichern"
              title="Route speichern"
            >
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M3 16.5v2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 5.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 21 18.75V16.5M16.5 12 12 16.5m0 0-4.5-4.5M12 16.5V3"></path>
              </svg>
            </button>
            <button
